+              - renesas,r9a09g047e37 # Dual Cortex-A55 + Cortex-M33 + Ethos-U55 (15mm BGA)
+              - renesas,r9a09g047e38 # Dual Cortex-A55 + Cortex-M33 + Ethos-U55 (21mm BGA)
